      "tier": "original",
      "claim": "Deployment 14 introduces rating-based diminishing resistance returns; initial weapon/tool rank-two rating 20 is superseded by Deployment 14.8 rank-two rating 12.",
      "sources": [
        "deployment_14_11112008.html@@20081115092604.html.txt:39",
